WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.851
(dreamy music)

00:00:02.851 --> 00:00:04.460
- [Narrator] When it's cold outside,

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:07.610
there's nothing like a warm
bath to take off the chill.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:11.027
And these monkeys have found a great one.

00:00:15.611 --> 00:00:18.510
The Jigokudani Valley in
Japan is buried in snow

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:21.358
for almost one third of the year.

00:00:21.358 --> 00:00:24.238
The area is more commonly
known as Hell's Valley,

00:00:24.238 --> 00:00:27.038
named for its high
altitude, jagged cliffs,

00:00:27.038 --> 00:00:31.205
and bubbling hot springs
that fill the air with steam.

00:00:33.249 --> 00:00:36.067
The local Japanese
macaques or snow monkeys

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:38.278
have found an interesting way to adapt

00:00:38.278 --> 00:00:40.361
to these cold conditions.

00:00:42.827 --> 00:00:46.567
In the early 1960s, these
clever and curious creatures

00:00:46.567 --> 00:00:48.539
moved down from the higher forests

00:00:48.539 --> 00:00:51.849
and tested the water of
the natural hot springs.

00:00:51.849 --> 00:00:54.027
They have been using
them as a spa to warm up

00:00:54.027 --> 00:00:56.694
in the winter months ever since.

00:00:59.827 --> 00:01:01.659
These snow monkeys like company.

00:01:01.659 --> 00:01:04.139
Their average group is
typically 41 monkeys,

00:01:04.139 --> 00:01:06.556
but can range from 10 to 161.

00:01:07.966 --> 00:01:09.467
They're not picky eaters, either.

00:01:09.467 --> 00:01:10.739
They'll eat just about everything

00:01:10.739 --> 00:01:13.358
from seeds, plants and fruits,

00:01:13.358 --> 00:01:16.691
or a handout from a mischievous tourist.

00:01:18.166 --> 00:01:20.227
Even in the high mountains of Japan,

00:01:20.227 --> 00:01:23.979
these clever critters have
found a great way to relax.

00:01:23.979 --> 00:01:25.312
Spa day, anyone?

00:01:26.627 --> 00:01:29.678
(upbeat music)

00:01:29.678 --> 00:01:32.595
(electronic music)

